### Color

| Token | Hex | Use |
|---|---|---|
| Paper | `#FFFFFF` | Page base. Pure white, no cream. |
| Drafting grey | `#F5F6F9` | Alternate panels, form fields |
| Rule | `#E3E6EE` | Hairlines, dot grid |
| Graphite | `#7D8392` | All line art, secondary text |
