### S12. Pricing

**Copy**

- **H2:** Priced per corpus, not per seat.
- **Body:** Reviewers, attorneys and PIs need the same evidence. They shouldn't each pay to see it.

| Tier | Price | For | Key inclusions |
|---|---|---|---|
| Lab | $0 | First 25 documents, one run | Harvest, full evidence trail, PDF and CSV export |
| Department | $1,900/mo | Up to 2,000 docs/month | Harvest and Seed, unlimited reviewers, Git and Drive connectors, audit export |
| Agency | $3,400/mo | Up to 10 client workspaces | Everything in Department, walled workspaces, shared docket, white-label briefs, billing export |
| Enterprise | Talk to us | Portfolio scale | Private or on-prem deployment, custom prior-art sources, SSO, named engineer |

**Note under the table:** A document is one PDF, DOCX, LaTeX project or repository snapshot. A 400-page thesis counts once. Re-runs only charge for new material.

**Callouts:** none. The pricing model itself is the investor signal, so there's no need to annotate it.

